<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13622" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dē-vŏlo</span></b> ,
		āre, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. n., to fly down</i> or <i>away</i>
			(very rare). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b>
			<i>To fly down</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">devolant angues jubati deorsum in impluvium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Am. 5, 1, 56</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Iris per caelum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 4, 702</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sibi de caelo devolaturam in sinum victoriam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					7, 12, 13</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			<i>To fly away</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">turdus devolet illuc, ubi, etc.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					S. 2, 5, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">phoenicem devolavisse in Aegyptum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					10, 2, 2, § 5</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>to hasten down, to
				fly</i> or <i>hasten away</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">de tribunali,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 2,
					29</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in terram,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					6, 205</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praecipites in forum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 3,
					15</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">raptim ad puerum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 105, 8</span></i>
			: ab afflicta amicitia transfugere atque ad florentem aliam
			devolare, * <i><span class="en">Cic. Quint. 30,
			93</span></i>; cf. <i>absol.</i>
			<i><span class="en">Auct. Her. 4, 17, 24</span></i>.</div>
